"Mark Opaque XR framebuffers as incomplete on session end" (crbug 578670966;
no CVE listed yet): a WebXR opaque framebuffer stayed complete when the
session ended during a frame, leaving orphaned shared image texture
handles reachable through it; it is now marked incomplete and its color
textures detached at the end of each frame. chromium/src main commit
3897d801449d24a4247b38366d66dae9491ded08 (main@{#1729896}), merged on
2026-10-30 to 157 as 67b1826c23115ecbaaaa47d96ff5e3e18f966ba1
(refs/branch-heads/8103@{#1005}, after the 157.0.8103.33 tag); merges to 156
and 158 proposed. This is the 157 merge, without its test. Drop it once a
157 tag has it.

